msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion has taken on a very different face from when Giselle was leading me through its "
"halls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫这座馆变了——⟪k:1⟫变得和之前吉赛儿作为「馆中女仆」牵我走过时，大不相同。⟪k:2⟫不知来源的血，"
"⟪k:3⟫不光在我脚边沉积——"

#: search2:search2_C56DA4F8_1A75_46EB_ADAA_B7EA8720943F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38866f833f8da5a5019953174debffb1d2c66e97ffed1eab96ce4830320e1eeb
